ts of the casual bathroom experience with increasing difficulty as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through each post night objectives to unlock more of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/3860070a282777b5a370610e00ab4a3c.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/3860070a282777b5a370610e00ab4a3c.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/3860070a282777b5a370610e00ab4a3c.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings to uncover what really lies within the walls of this bathroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/ddd9b06b766a0af30bfbc4b5c3ba391e.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/ddd9b06b766a0af30bfbc4b5c3ba391e.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/ddd9b06b766a0af30bfbc4b5c3ba391e.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
